# The Chamber of Oracles (Zilart 7, mission.zilart.the_chamber_of_oracles): the eight fragments held. Each
# pedestal adds its bit to the Zilart status and says YOU_PLACE_THE (7645, its fragment): Fire 1, Darkness 2,
# Earth 4, Ice 8, Light 16, Lightning 32, Water 64, Wind 128; a set bit says IS_SET_IN_THE_PEDESTAL (7646).
# The pedestal that brings the status to 255 also plays 1; its finish takes the eight fragments and completes
# the mission: the Prismatic Fragment (KEYITEM_OBTAINED 6398), the Lightweaver title, Return to Delkfutt's
# Tower current. Completed, each pedestal says HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER (7647, its fragment).
lists ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Fire/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Darkness/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Earth/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Ice/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Light/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Lightning/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Water/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/Pedestal_of_Wind/onTrigger ChamberOfOracles/onEventFinish/1
char zone=ChamberOfOracles pos=200.3419,-2.25,37.12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheChamberOfOracles current
keyitem FireFragment
keyitem WaterFragment
keyitem EarthFragment
keyitem WindFragment
keyitem LightningFragment
keyitem IceFragment
keyitem LightFragment
keyitem DarkFragment
login
trigger Pedestal_of_Fire                # +1: status 1
trigger Pedestal_of_Fire                # bit 1 set: IS_SET_IN_THE_PEDESTAL
trigger Pedestal_of_Darkness            # +2: status 3
trigger Pedestal_of_Earth               # +4: status 7
trigger Pedestal_of_Ice                 # +8: status 15
trigger Pedestal_of_Light               # +16: status 31
trigger Pedestal_of_Lightning           # +32: status 63
trigger Pedestal_of_Water               # +64: status 127
trigger Pedestal_of_Wind                # +128: status 255, then 1
finish                                  # the fragments taken, completed
trigger Pedestal_of_Fire                # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Darkness            # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Earth               # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Ice                 # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Light               # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Lightning           # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Water               # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
trigger Pedestal_of_Wind                # completed: HAS_LOST_ITS_POWER
